{"4898460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Outspin Champions", "steam_appid": 4898460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4899290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outspin Champions is a local competitive PvP / Co-op brawler where the spinning never stops. It blends party-game chaos with Souls-like precision, mastering physics-driven weapon weight to deflect foes. Outspin. Outsmart. Outlast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/570c9cd0864ef4c358857a568b721379.poster.avif?t=1787655977\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/570c9cd0864ef4c358857a568b721379.webm?t=1787655977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/570c9cd0864ef4c358857a568b721379.mp4?t=1787655977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The “Constant Spin” Combat Engine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanic of the game centers around characters who are constantly spinning. This continuous rotational momentum forces players to parry incoming attacks and deal damage with their equipped weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Arena Structure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built as a highly competitive third-person arena fighting game. Match flow is kept quick and intense by utilizing a “best of 3” round system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/be4323dcee95c77942fad3ed56962523.poster.avif?t=1787655977\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/be4323dcee95c77942fad3ed56962523.webm?t=1787655977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/be4323dcee95c77942fad3ed56962523.mp4?t=1787655977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer &amp; Couch Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an ocean of online games, we are bringing back good old couch multiplayer and co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Stakes Sudden Death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches don't end in anticlimactic draws; if opposing teams have the same combined health when the round timer hits zero, the referee system forces a Sudden Death tie-breaker. To maximize tension, all surviving characters have their health instantly reduced to 1 for this final clash.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outspin Champions is a local competitive PvP / Co-op brawler where the spinning never stops. It blends party-game chaos with Souls-like precision, mastering physics-driven weapon weight to deflect foes. Outspin. Outsmart. Outlast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/570c9cd0864ef4c358857a568b721379.poster.avif?t=1787655977\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/570c9cd0864ef4c358857a568b721379.webm?t=1787655977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/570c9cd0864ef4c358857a568b721379.mp4?t=1787655977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The “Constant Spin” Combat Engine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanic of the game centers around characters who are constantly spinning. This continuous rotational momentum forces players to parry incoming attacks and deal damage with their equipped weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Arena Structure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built as a highly competitive third-person arena fighting game. Match flow is kept quick and intense by utilizing a “best of 3” round system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/be4323dcee95c77942fad3ed56962523.poster.avif?t=1787655977\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/be4323dcee95c77942fad3ed56962523.webm?t=1787655977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4898460/extras/be4323dcee95c77942fad3ed56962523.mp4?t=1787655977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer &amp; Couch Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an ocean of online games, we are bringing back good old couch multiplayer and co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Stakes Sudden Death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches don't end in anticlimactic draws; if opposing teams have the same combined health when the round timer hits zero, the referee system forces a Sudden Death tie-breaker. To maximize tension, all surviving characters have their health instantly reduced to 1 for this final clash.</p>", "short_description": "Outspin Champions is a local competitive PvP / Co-op brawler where the spinning never stops. It blends party-game chaos with Souls-like precision, mastering physics-driven weapon weight to deflect foes. Outspin. Outsmart. Outlast.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header